<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>ENTP</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">樊宇镈(Coulson Fan)</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">ENTP</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0OvsdQdclJdS6dQspsaKzt</ttm:item><itunes:duration>03:40.000</itunes:duration></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.810" end="00:02.310">ENTP</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.360" end="00:02.860">作词: 樊宇镈</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.850" end="00:03.350">作曲: 樊宇镈</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.420" end="00:03.920">编曲: 樊宇镈</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.900" end="00:04.400">统筹：王若彤</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.330" end="00:04.830">监制：王若彤</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.700" end="00:11.700">出品人：李林鸿@大音工作室</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.720" end="00:16.220">I walk in like I own the plot,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.720" end="00:17.620">我总是一副自信满满的样子，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.620" end="00:19.120">Talk fast, think faster,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.620" end="00:21.270">思维活跃话有时很多，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.270" end="00:22.770">Change the topic before it hurts,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.270" end="00:24.540">熟练的在社交里切换话题，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.540" end="00:26.040">Make you laugh, then disappear after,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.540" end="00:27.740">让无数人开心 却从不留恋，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.740" end="00:29.240">I flirt like a reflex,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.740" end="00:30.540">他们说我是调情高手，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.540" end="00:32.040">Stay one step from the edge,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.540" end="00:34.550">因为我总能把控好距离，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.550" end="00:36.050">If I care too much, I’ll joke，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.550" end="00:37.900">如果我发现我在意了我会假装无所谓，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.900" end="00:39.400">Pretend it’s all in my head，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.900" end="00:41.660">装作那些情绪是我脑补的剧情，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.660" end="00:43.160">It’s not that I don’t feel，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.660" end="00:45.550">总有人说我没有感情，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.550" end="00:47.050">It’s that I feel too quick，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.550" end="00:48.970">看起来我像一个浪子一样，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.970" end="00:50.470">By the time you understand,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.970" end="00:51.300">但其实是因为我的感情来去都很快，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.300" end="00:52.800">I’ve already made the exit，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.300" end="00:54.010">除了遇到那几个例外，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.010" end="00:55.510">I said I’d leave，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.010" end="00:57.700">我说过我会离开，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.700" end="00:59.200">But I waited,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.700" end="01:00.500">但我却停了下来，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.500" end="01:02.000">You laughed, so I played it cool,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.500" end="01:03.760">我笑着装傻，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.760" end="01:05.260">But I hesitated,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.760" end="01:07.250">但内心早已翻涌，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.250" end="01:08.750">I’m a runner，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.250" end="01:09.100">我明明很洒脱，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.100" end="01:10.600">Who never packed,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.100" end="01:11.070">但为何这次如此难放下，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.070" end="01:12.570">I’m a fire，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.070" end="01:12.570">我明明向往自由，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.430" end="01:13.930">That won’t come back，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.430" end="01:14.980">但为何停下脚步，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.980" end="01:16.480">But I stayed,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.980" end="01:17.210">或许是我一直在等，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.210" end="01:18.710">You just never asked,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.210" end="01:24.160">等你在说一句“请别离开”，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.160" end="01:25.660">I’ve got plans I never finish，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.160" end="01:25.820">我总有些没完成的计划，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.820" end="01:27.320">Dreams I never rest,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.820" end="01:27.420">总在做着不肯落地的梦，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.420" end="01:28.920">People call me chaos,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.420" end="01:29.030">别人说我混乱，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.030" end="01:30.530">But I just call it defense,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.030" end="01:30.920">但我知道这就是我的风格，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.920" end="01:32.420">I told you “don’t fall for me”，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.920" end="01:32.460">会告诉你“别迷上我”，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.460" end="01:33.960">Then sent you songs at 2AM,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.460" end="01:34.090">却凌在晨给你发了你喜欢的歌，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.090" end="01:35.590">Said I’m not the staying type，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.090" end="01:35.720">我说过我从不为爱停留，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.720" end="01:37.220">But memorized the way you bend,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.720" end="01:37.430">却驻足于你微笑时的眼眸，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.430" end="01:38.930">I leave before it gets too quiet,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.430" end="01:39.230">我总是在变安静前逃离，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.230" end="01:40.730">Then miss the noise I made,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.230" end="01:40.850">然后想念曾经吵闹的自己，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.850" end="01:42.350">Tell myself “you’re better off”，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.850" end="01:42.710">我告诉自己离开你“我值得更好的”，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.710" end="01:44.210">But hope I still replayed,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.710" end="01:44.250">可又希望你会忘不掉我，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.250" end="01:45.750">I smile like I’ve moved on，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.250" end="01:45.990">我笑着说早已放下，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.990" end="01:47.490">But check your page each night,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.990" end="01:47.600">有时却去看你的动态，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.600" end="01:49.100">Say “I don’t believe in fate”，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.600" end="01:49.130">我说我不信命运，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.130" end="01:50.630">Yet still hold on too tight,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.130" end="01:50.810">却一直死死抓着那一点期待，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.810" end="01:52.310">I hate the word “forever”，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.810" end="01:53.650">我讨厌“永远”这词，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.650" end="01:55.150">But I built a world in my mind,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.650" end="01:57.050">却在脑海里建起一个世界，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.050" end="01:58.550">Where you stayed just long enough,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.050" end="02:00.770">那里也许存放着和你的记忆，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.770" end="02:02.270">To call me yours, one time,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.770" end="02:03.700">还有我曾幻想过的我们的未来，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.700" end="02:05.200">I said I’d leave，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.700" end="02:06.880">我说过我会离开，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.880" end="02:08.380">But I waited,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.880" end="02:10.920">但我却停了下来，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.920" end="02:12.420">You smiled, so I stayed brave,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.920" end="02:14.480">也许是你的笑容给了我勇气，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.480" end="02:15.980">But I faded,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.480" end="02:17.260">但内心早已翻涌，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.260" end="02:18.760">I’m a wanderer，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.260" end="02:19.310">我明明很洒脱，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.310" end="02:20.810">With your name,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.310" end="02:21.340">但却忘不了你的名字，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.340" end="02:22.840">I’m a storm，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.340" end="02:23.340">我明明向往自由，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.340" end="02:24.840">You couldn’t tame，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.340" end="02:24.950">但为何停下脚步，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.950" end="02:26.450">But I stayed,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.950" end="02:27.510">或许是我一直在等，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.510" end="02:29.010">Just… never explained，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.510" end="02:32.210">等你在说一句“请别离开”，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.210" end="02:33.710">You said I talk too much,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.210" end="02:34.200">在你眼里我或许是个自大的话痨，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.200" end="02:35.700">But I only joke to survive,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.200" end="02:37.530">但其实我一直在用笑掩饰情绪，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.530" end="02:39.030">Every punchline,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.530" end="02:39.090">每句玩笑里，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.090" end="02:40.590">Hides the truth I won’t write，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.090" end="02:44.160">都有一句没敢说的“我在乎你”，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.160" end="02:45.660">I made it easy to leave,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.160" end="02:47.830">我把“离开”说得轻描淡写，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.830" end="02:49.330">So no one had to ask me to stay,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.830" end="02:51.140">因为我知道没人会在意我，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.140" end="02:52.640">I said I’m good at endings，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.140" end="02:53.810">所以我说我擅长告别，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.810" end="02:55.310">But I never knew what to say,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.810" end="02:57.580">其实我最怕离别时的沉默，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.580" end="02:59.080">I said I’d leave，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.580" end="03:01.100">我说过我会离开，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.100" end="03:02.600">But I waited,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.100" end="03:04.150">但我却停了下来，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.150" end="03:05.650">You laughed, so I played it cool,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.150" end="03:07.300">我笑着装傻，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.300" end="03:08.800">But I hesitated,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.300" end="03:11.500">但内心早已翻涌，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.500" end="03:13.000">I’m a runner，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.500" end="03:13.770">我明明很洒脱，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.770" end="03:15.270">Who never packed,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.770" end="03:15.270">但为何这次如此难放下，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.150" end="03:16.650">I’m a fire，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.150" end="03:16.920">我明明向往自由，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.920" end="03:18.420">That won’t come back，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.920" end="03:18.710">但为何停下脚步，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.710" end="03:20.210">But I stayed,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.710" end="03:22.490">或许是我一直在等，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.490" end="03:23.990">You just never asked,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.490" end="03:30.490">只是你，从没开口挽留，</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:32.630" end="03:34.130">I just never explained,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:32.630" end="03:36.630">我也，从未开口解释。</p></div></body></tt>